Third-party and derived code
----------------------------
Parts of this project are derived from Zed (https://github.com/zed-industries/zed),
which is licensed under GPL-3.0-or-later (applications and most crates) and
Apache-2.0 (gpui and the extension API definitions):

  crates/forge_extensions   The extension manifest (src/manifest.rs) follows
                            Zed's `extension` crate (extension_manifest.rs).
                            The theme reader (src/theme.rs) reads Zed's theme file
                            format. The registry client mirrors the shape of Zed's
                            /extensions API.

Files derived from Zed keep a note naming their origin. When code is copied,
its original copyright header stays in the file.

Extensions installed from the Forge registry are separate works and carry their
own licenses; they are downloaded at the user's request and are not part of this
distribution.
